          <h3>Österreichischer Verband Financial Planners  (OVFP)</h3>
          <p>Established in 2000, Österreichischer Verband Financial Planners  is a nonprofit, professional standards-setting organization supported by the financial services sector in Austria, including banking, insurance and independent financial consultants, as well as the legal profession and academicians.</p>
