                    <strong>
                        <span>Germany</span>
                                </strong>
          <h3>Financial Planning Standards Board Deutschland e.V. (FPSB Deutschland)</h3>
          <p>Founded in 1997, FPSB Deutschland administers the CERTIFIED FINANCIAL PLANNER certification program, and develops and supervises quality standards for professional training and education, qualification requirements, and ethical and practice standards for CFP professionals in Germany.</p>
        </section>
