                    <strong>
                        <span>Hong Kong</span>
                                </strong>
          <h3>Institute of Financial Planners of Hong Kong Ltd. (IFPHK)</h3>
          <p>A nonprofit self-regulatory organization founded in June 2000, The Institute of Financial Planners of Hong Kong fosters professional standards in personal financial planning to benefit the public. IFPHK grants the CERTIFIED FINANCIAL PLANNER certification to qualified financial planning professionals in Hong Kong and Macau, and is committed to promoting the CFP designation as the symbol of excellence in financial planning.</p>
        </section>
