        <section>
          <a href="#" class="cancel control" title="Close"><i class="fa fa-close"></i></a>
                    <strong>
                        <span>India</span>
                                </strong>
          <h3>FPSB India</h3>
          <p>FPSB India is the leading financial planning body in India and is dedicated to establishing, upholding and promoting professional standards in financial planning throughout India. FPSB India offers the globally recognized CFP certification, which represents excellence in financial planning through rigorous competency and ethical standards. FPSB India is the Indian subsidiary of Financial Planning Standards Board Ltd., the global standards-setting body for the financial planning profession and owner of the international CERTIFIED FINANCIAL PLANNER certification program.</p>
        </section>
