          <a href="#" class="cancel control" title="Close"><i class="fa fa-close"></i></a>
                    <strong>
                        <span>Indonesia</span>
                                </strong>
          <h3>Financial Planning Standards Board Indonesia (FPSB Indonesia)</h3>
          <p>Established in 2006, FPSB Indonesia is a nonprofit organization offering the REGISTERED FINANCIAL PLANNER and CERTIFIED FINANCIAL PLANNER designations. FPSB Indonesia holds the LSP-P (Professional Certification Body – Proficiency) from BNSP (Indonesian Professionals Certification Authority), a governmental body in charge of certifying professionals. FPSB Indonesia operates to benefit consumers and establish financial planning as a profession in Indonesia.</p>
        </section>
