<div class="modal modal-territory" data-location-id="513">
  <div class="modal-wrap">
    <div class="message">
      <div class="figure">
        <section>
          <a href="#" class="cancel control" title="Close"><i class="fa fa-close"></i></a>
                    <strong>
                        <span>The Netherlands</span>
                                </strong>
          <h3>Federatie Financieel Planners (Federation of Financial Planners)</h3>
          <p>The Federation of Financial Planners (FFP) is the professional organization for financial planners in The Netherlands, and offers the CERTIFIED FINANCIAL PLANNER certification program in addition to the FFP quality mark.With approximately 4,000 members, the FFP is the largest European organization of financial planners. FPSB Nederland, which first offered CFP certification in the territory in 2009, merged with FFP in 2015.</p>
        </section>
