<div class="modal modal-territory" data-location-id="531">
  <div class="modal-wrap">
    <div class="message">
      <div class="figure">
        <section>
          <a href="#" class="cancel control" title="Close"><i class="fa fa-close"></i></a>
                    <strong>
                        <span>South Africa</span>
                                </strong>
          <h3>Financial Planning Institute of Southern Africa  (FPI)</h3>
          <p>The Financial Planning Institute of Southern Africa is the leading, independent representative body of professional financial planners in South Africa. The FPI works to ensure that South Africans have access to the services of competent, ethical financial planners who will place their interests first. Many top financial institutions have adopted the FPI as an independent standards partner, and FPI members include both general practitioners and specialists in particular branches of financial planning.</p>
        </section>
        <aside>
                    <figure>
            <img src="/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/southafrica-300x200.jpg" alt="Financial Planning Institute of Southern Africa  (FPI)" style="width: 100%;" />
