                    <strong>
                        <span>Israel</span>
                                </strong>
          <h3>Financial Planners Association in Israel (FPAI)</h3>
          <p>Established in October 2011, FPAI, formerly known as the Union of Financial Planners in Israel (UFPI), partners with FPSB to offer CFP certification in Israel. FPAI’s mission is to support financial professionals in learning the right abilities, skills and knowledge to deliver competent, ethical financial planning to clients.</p>
        </section>
